      "translation": "Wähle den Snowsky ECHO (das Modell in voller Größe). Installiere Gnarlyr separat mit der <a href=\"install.html\">Installationsanleitung</a>."
    },
    "home.m087": {
      "source": "As an Amazon Associate I earn from qualifying purchases. I may also earn a commission from AliExpress links.",
